  "text": "can use Nemotron in different ways."
 },
 {
  "start": 94.17,
  "end": 96.9,
  "text": "For example, ServiceNow trained their own"
 },
 {
  "start": 96.9,
  "end": 100.13,
  "text": "AI model using the Nemotron training data sets."
 },
 {
  "start": 101.1,
  "end": 104.1,
  "text": "training technology."
 },
 {
  "start": 104.13,
  "end": 105.3,
  "text": "We were able to take"
 },
 {
  "start": 105.3,
  "end": 109.37,
  "text": "reasoning technology with Nemotron."
 },
 {
  "start": 109.93,
  "end": 112.67,
  "text": "releasing our pre-training data sets."
 },
 {
  "start": 112.67,
  "end": 115.67,
  "text": "training and alignment,"
 },
 {
  "start": 115.97,
  "end": 121.1,
  "text": "and the GPU software that makes it seem."
 },
 {
  "start": 122.93,
  "end": 127.2,
  "text": "people oppose general intelligence"
 },
 {
  "start": 127.2,
  "end": 130.33,
  "text": "and we actually want both."
 },
 {
  "start": 130.57,
  "end": 133.8,
  "text": "because that's the raw material."
 },
 {
  "start": 133.87,
  "end": 137.3,
  "text": "that general intelligence isn't enough."
 },
 {
  "start": 137.57,
  "end": 138.93,
  "text": "We have to apply ourselves,"
 },
 {
  "start": 138.93,
  "end": 141.93,
  "text": "at the right time to solve problems."
 },
 {
  "start": 142.17,
  "end": 144.0,
  "text": "That's where specialized AI comes in."
 },
 {
  "start": 145.5,
  "end": 147.2,
  "text": "Every company has a unique way"
 },
 {
  "start": 147.2,
  "end": 150.3,
  "text": "that they're solving with their business."
 },
 {
  "start": 150.3,
  "end": 152.37,
  "text": "That's something that only they know."
 },
 {
  "start": 152.37,
  "end": 155.2,
  "text": "Our goal with Nemotron is to raise the bar"
 },
 {
  "start": 155.2,
  "end": 158.5,
  "text": "but provide that intelligence in a way"
 },
 {
  "start": 158.5,
  "end": 162.1,
  "text": "to specialize it for their own problems."
 },
 {
  "start": 163.73,
  "end": 167.57,
  "text": "and we're really excited"
 },
 {
  "start": 167.57,
  "end": 170.83,
  "text": "working together."
 },
 {
  "start": 171.0,
  "end": 172.53,
  "text": "And with Nemotron technology."
 },
 {
  "start": 172.53,
  "end": 175.5,
  "text": "around the world,"
 },
 {
  "start": 175.5,
  "end": 178.5,
  "text": "build and deploy AI."
 },
 {
  "start": 180.8,
  "end": 182.27,
  "text": "Nemotron is a huge effort,"
 },
 {
  "start": 182.27,
  "end": 185.57,
  "text": "across many parts of the company"
 },
 {
  "start": 185.57,
  "end": 189.6,
  "text": "from accelerated computing to AI,"
 },
 {
  "start": 189.6,
  "end": 194.03,
  "text": "all the way from the model architectures"
 },
 {
  "start": 194.03,
  "end": 197.77,
  "text": "in the compute that runs it."
 },
 {
  "start": 199.23,
  "end": 200.8,
  "text": "It's a great honor for me."
 },
 {
  "start": 200.8,
  "end": 204.27,
  "text": "to decide, why am I going to work today?"
 },
 {
  "start": 204.4,
  "end": 208.8,
  "text": "to the development of this technology"
 },
 {
  "start": 209.03,
  "end": 213.27,
  "text": "and researchers around the industry."
 },
 {
  "start": 213.7,
